  "body": "Step into this beautifully designed new 2025 residence, offering effortless modern living with beautiful water views stretching across to Takapuna and the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully crafted, the home features a spacious bedroom layout complemented by a large, sun-filled living area, designed to maximise comfort and natural light. A separate flexi room adds outstanding versatility, ideal as a second bedroom, media room, or additional living space depending on your needs.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan design creates a seamless flow between living, dining, and relaxation zones, while large windows frame the stunning outlook and capture all-day sun.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Brand new 2025 build\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality finishes, large open living area\r\n• Separate flexible room (2nd bedroom or second lounge)\r\n• Stunning water views to Takapuna & Hauraki Gulf\r\n• Light-filled, contemporary design\r\n\r\nThis property represents an exceptional opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a low-maintenance home in a premium position.\r\n\r\nEnjoy modern comfort, flexibility, and an unbeatable outlook—all in one stylish package.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
